.* QWCTFRGJ: TFRGRPJOB GRPJOB(*SELECT) and System Request option 13,
.* the other jobs of the group to transfer to.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NUMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPJOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOBNBR CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=CURGRP CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=GRPJOBS VARS='OPT GRPJOB JOBNBR GRPTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=TFRGRPJOB KEYL=KEYS HELP=TFRGRPH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Transfer to Group Job
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=CURGRP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CURGRP'.Current group job
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type option, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=GRPJOBS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=1 HELP='TFRGRPJOB/OPTIONS'.1=Select
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='TFRGRPJOB/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPJOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/GRPJOB'.Group Job
:LISTCOL VAR=JOBNBR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBNBR'.Number
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/GRPTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=TFRGRPH.Transfer to Group Job - Help
:P.The other jobs of your group. Type 1 next to one and press Enter to
move the display to it; this job waits until a job of the group moves
the display back.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave the list and return to this job.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CURGRP'.Current group job
:P.The current group job shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TFRGRPJOB/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GRPJOB'.Group Job
:P.The group job.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOBNBR'.Number
:P.The number of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GRPTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TFRGRPJOB/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Select
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to select it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
